You can set a Hotkey to open the Menu/Settings in the Elder Scrolls Online Keybindings Menu under the Catergory SyncMotes
Commands:

/sm menu - Open the SyncMotes Menu
/sm list - Shows the SyncMotes EmoteList
/sm on - Start listening to selected Chats
/sm off - Stop listening to selected Chats
/sm [EMOTE-ID] - Enters the SyncMotes command line into Chat !!(you need to hit Enter afterwards)!!
/sm [EMOTENAME] - Enters the SyncMotes command line into Chat !!(you need to hit Enter afterwards)!!
/sm add [Phrase] [YourDelay(ms)] [YourEmote-ID] [OthersDelay(ms)] [OthersEmote-ID] - Adds a SyncPhrase
/sm phrase - Shows a list of SyncPhrases and their ID in a Window


